{
  "job_B2.2.3_20251003_114501": {
    "text": "To Eallum Folke.\nLeofan menn, understanda\u00f0 georne, eallswa eow mycel \u00f0earf is, \u00fe\u00e6t ge eowres cristendomes gescead\nAnd butan ge hit on Leden geleornian magan, geleornia\u00f0 hit on Englisc \u00feus: Eala ure f\u00e6der \u00fee on\n& \u00f0in ricedom ofer us rixie symble, & \u00f0in willa gewyr\u00f0e swa swa on heofonum eac swa on eor\u00f0an.\nGeunn us to \u00feissum d\u00e6ge d\u00e6ghwamlices fostres.\nAnd us gemildsa swa swa we miltsia\u00f0 \u00feam \u00f0e wi\u00f0 us agylta\u00fe; & ne l\u00e6t \u00f0u us costnian ealles to swy\u00f0e,\nGloria patri et filio et spiritui sancto.\nA sy lof & wuldor f\u00e6der & suna & halgum gaste, swa swa on fruman w\u00e6s & gyt is & symble bi\u00f0 in\nLeofan men, utan don swa us mycel \u00feearf is, habban anr\u00e6dne geleafan & fulne hiht on urne Drihten.\nAnd se \u00f0e \u00feurh Ledenspr\u00e6ce rihtne geleafan understandan ne cunne, geleornige huru on Englisc &\nWe gelyfa\u00f0 on \u00e6nne God \u00e6lmihtigne \u00fee ealle \u00feingc gesceop & geworhte.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 & georne witan \u00fe\u00e6t Crist Godes sunu to mannum com for ealles mancynnes \u00f0earfe.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hine cl\u00e6ne m\u00e6den geb\u00e6re, Sancta Maria, \u00fee n\u00e6fre nahte weres gemanan.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he mycel ge\u00f0olode & sti\u00f0lice \u00ferowode for ure ealra neode.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hine man on rode ahenge & hine to dea\u00f0e acwealde & hine sy\u00f0\u00f0an on eor\u00f0an\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he to helle ferde & \u00f0\u00e6rof gehergode eal \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he sy\u00f0\u00f0an of dea\u00f0e arise.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6fter \u00feam to heofonum astige.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 & georne witan \u00fe\u00e6t he on domes d\u00e6g to \u00f0am miclan dome cym\u00f0, & we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a synfullan sculon \u00feanon on an to helle faran & \u00f0\u00e6r a sy\u00f0\u00f0an mid deoflum\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a godan & wel cristenan \u00fee her on worulde Gode wel gecwemdon \u00feonne on an\n\u00c6lc Cristen man ah mycle \u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0is wite & \u00f0isses rihtlice gelyfe; & se \u00f0e his credan elles ne\nAnd utan don swa us mycel \u00feearf is, habban \u00e6fre rihtne geleafan & fulne hiht on God \u00e6lmihtigne &\n\u00deonne geleana\u00f0 he hit us swa us leofost by\u00f0.\nHim sy lof & wuldor aa butan ende, amen.\nPrimo necesse est ut paganus caticuminus sit, accedensque ad baptismum ut abrenuntiaet maligno\nCatecuminus Grece, instructus dicitur Latine.\nCatecuminus enim instrui debet quatinus unitatem fidei agnoscens sacrosanctum baptismatis misterium\nIn cuius quoque facie a sacerdote per exsufflationem signum crucis sit, ut effugato diabolo Cristo,\nExorcizatur etiam idem malignus spiritus, ut exeat et recedat ab illo plasmate quod iamdudum per\nEt idcirco qui baptizandus est salem in sacramento accipit, ut gustum sapientie percipiat, neque a\nSal enim sapientiam significat, unde Dominus in euangelio ad discipluos: Uos, inquit, estis sal terre.\nTraditur ei simbolum, id est, uere fidei integra confessio, ut domus prisco habitatore derelicta fide\nTangit quoque sacerdos desputo oris sui nares et aures, ut audiendo atque odorando percipiat sanctitatis\nPerunguitur etiam pectus, sed et scapule sacro crismate ad tutamen mentis et corporis, ut undique\nUnctio forinseca ostendit quid intus operetur spiritus sanctus ad inuocationem sacerdotis. Unctione\nBaptismum Grece, unctio Latine interpretatur; in baptismate igitur fit peccatorum remissio, per\nIn consecratione baptismatis prima oratio deprecatur Dominum adesse, ut ex ipse oratione possumus\nOmnipotens, inquit, sempiterne Deus, adesto magne pietatis tue misteriis, et reliqua.\nPer insuflationem sacerdotis monstratur inmundus spiritus expelli, ut illud inpleatur quod Dominus\nClamante autem uoce sacerdotis, ut descendat uirtus spiritus sancti in aquam, cereus benedictus\nQuare hoc, nisi ut demonstretur modo cereus significare spiritum sanctum?\nLegitur unam columnam fuisse in itinere filiorum Israel, quando egressi sunt ex Egipto per Mare\nHabuit ergo mare formam aque, nubes uero spiritus sanctus.\nAqua igitur baptismatis exhibet sacramentum forinsecus, et spiritus sanctus operatur intrinsecus\nBaptizatur autem sub trina mersione in nomine sancte trinitatis, id est, patris et filii et spiritus sancti.\nEt recte ut homo, qui ad imaginem Dei conditus est, per inuocationem sancte trinitatis ad eandem\nInduiturque candida ueste.\nQuare, nisi ut demonstretur per baptismum recipere quod per primum hominem in paradiso\nUestimenta candida et inreprehensibilia sunt spiritales uirtutes anime. Perunguitur et caput sacro\nCommunicatur corpore et sanguine dominico, ut illius sit capitis membrum qui pro eo passus est et\nTraditurque per inpostionem manus episcopi spiritus paraclitus cum frontem sacro crismate signauerit\nHec enim sunt uestimenta quibus ornari oportet filium regis ut possit stare in aula celesti.",
